## Setup

Use a supported Node.js version and the pinned pnpm version in
[package.json](package.json). CI uses the Node.js version in
[.node-version](.node-version).

Run these commands from the repository root:

```sh
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
pnpm build
pnpm test
```

## Develop a package

The starter library lives in `packages/example-library`. Edit its greeting and
run `pnpm dev` to rebuild on changes. Run `pnpm validate` for workspace checks,
builds, and tests.

See the [package development guide](docs/development.md) to add another package
or consume its public exports from the workspace.
